<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96829" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιμμίζω</span></b>  (also written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιμίζω</span></b> ), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tinge</i> the eyelids <i>black with</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίμμι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Democr.
				<u>Symp.Ant.</u>
				p.5
			</span></i> G.:—
				Med.
			, <i>tinge</i> one's eyelids <i>with black</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.439
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ki.</u>
					9.30
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ez.</u>
				23.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later,
				<i>apply any eye-salve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.41
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιβίζομαι</span>.</div>
